		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Appears as a normal human, but is truly a cloud of axiomatic principles, formed from the foundational Order.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15 (chain + shield), <strong>HP</strong> 33, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 longsword +6 (1d8) or 1 lightning bolt, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cloud of Principles</strong>. Turn into a gaseous, sparkling cloud filled with ethereal math formulas for 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lightning Bolt</strong>. Ray of lightning hits all creatures in a far-length straight line for 3d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
